   "locked": false,
   "text": "Family recall is any-hit, not all-hit, and 548 of the 551 labelled-malice cases carry\nexactly one family tag. A recall of 0.9201 means the tagged family fired on 92 percent\nof cases. It does not mean 92 percent of the patterns present were listed: the detector\nfires three or more families on 57 percent of them, and those extras are neither\nrewarded nor penalised.",
